{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--This is a small-scale card game with linear, fixed stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Estimated playtime: around 1\u20133 hours, featuring 4 main chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--In this demo, you can experience the first 2 chapters, with a playtime of about 30 minutes, and play as 3 different characters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--If you enjoy the demo, please look forward to the full version with more chapters and content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/e444994db58fbd5f57f0789f894a5aa5.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a land far, far away. <br>Once a mighty kingdom, it has fallen into decline due to political strife. Hidden monsters are stirring, and the people are suffering in despair. <br>Until the arrival of three priests \u2014 chosen to carry out the will of the Goddess and save the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/ca665913218a3b6484062d2a55a3752d.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1383 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the priests and challenge various stages scattered across the kingdom. Clearing stages will grant you new believers and unlock new contracts (cards), allowing you to build an even stronger deck as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/92a9c9e21240f42ea6bd0af7804aa3ba.poster.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/92a9c9e21240f42ea6bd0af7804aa3ba.webm?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/92a9c9e21240f42ea6bd0af7804aa3ba.mp4?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/ff3c8e3319e88864a7663a41d6f85ff7.poster.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/ff3c8e3319e88864a7663a41d6f85ff7.webm?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/ff3c8e3319e88864a7663a41d6f85ff7.mp4?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release Contract</strong>: Spend Action Points to activate contracts, dealing damage or unleashing other powerful effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/0b6d73c0b73927c31381341b2e13f183.poster.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/0b6d73c0b73927c31381341b2e13f183.webm?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/0b6d73c0b73927c31381341b2e13f183.mp4?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devour Contract</strong>: Discard a contract to gain Action Points, securing resources while searching for better cards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/b4b981c742ab4e20a214d1dc503a397d.poster.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/b4b981c742ab4e20a214d1dc503a397d.webm?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/b4b981c742ab4e20a214d1dc503a397d.mp4?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering when to release or devour contracts will be the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classes</strong>: Three priests with completely different attributes, unique contracts, and special abilities. You can freely choose any one\u2014and it\u2019s even possible to clear the game with just a single priest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devour Mechanic</strong>: Discard cards to gain resources, speeding up deck cycling and strategy execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Consideration</strong>: Enemies don\u2019t just wait for your turn to end\u2014many will react to every action you make. Careful sequencing of your actions is critical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Options</strong>: Fast\u2026 or even faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The content of this demo is for trial purposes only. The final version of the game may be adjusted through optimization and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009930?t=1759501898","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4009930?t=1759501898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/91302b0692456a7fcf351931936739037cddbf54/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759501898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/91302b0692456a7fcf351931936739037cddbf54/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759501898","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--This is a small-scale card game with linear, fixed stages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--Estimated playtime: around 1\u20133 hours, featuring 4 main chapters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--In this demo, you can experience the first 2 chapters, with a playtime of about 30 minutes, and play as 3 different characters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--If you enjoy the demo, please look forward to the full version with more chapters and content!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/e444994db58fbd5f57f0789f894a5aa5.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1000 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Background Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in a land far, far away. <br>Once a mighty kingdom, it has fallen into decline due to political strife. Hidden monsters are stirring, and the people are suffering in despair. <br>Until the arrival of three priests \u2014 chosen to carry out the will of the Goddess and save the land.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/ca665913218a3b6484062d2a55a3752d.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1383 height=353 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose one of the priests and challenge various stages scattered across the kingdom. Clearing stages will grant you new believers and unlock new contracts (cards), allowing you to build an even stronger deck as you progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/92a9c9e21240f42ea6bd0af7804aa3ba.poster.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/92a9c9e21240f42ea6bd0af7804aa3ba.webm?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/92a9c9e21240f42ea6bd0af7804aa3ba.mp4?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/ff3c8e3319e88864a7663a41d6f85ff7.poster.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/ff3c8e3319e88864a7663a41d6f85ff7.webm?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/ff3c8e3319e88864a7663a41d6f85ff7.mp4?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat System</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Release Contract</strong>: Spend Action Points to activate contracts, dealing damage or unleashing other powerful effects.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/0b6d73c0b73927c31381341b2e13f183.poster.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/0b6d73c0b73927c31381341b2e13f183.webm?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/0b6d73c0b73927c31381341b2e13f183.mp4?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devour Contract</strong>: Discard a contract to gain Action Points, securing resources while searching for better cards.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/b4b981c742ab4e20a214d1dc503a397d.poster.avif?t=1759501898\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/b4b981c742ab4e20a214d1dc503a397d.webm?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/extras/b4b981c742ab4e20a214d1dc503a397d.mp4?t=1759501898\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering when to release or devour contracts will be the key to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classes</strong>: Three priests with completely different attributes, unique contracts, and special abilities. You can freely choose any one\u2014and it\u2019s even possible to clear the game with just a single priest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Devour Mechanic</strong>: Discard cards to gain resources, speeding up deck cycling and strategy execution.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Action Consideration</strong>: Enemies don\u2019t just wait for your turn to end\u2014many will react to every action you make. Careful sequencing of your actions is critical.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Speed Options</strong>: Fast\u2026 or even faster!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203b The content of this demo is for trial purposes only. The final version of the game may be adjusted through optimization and updates.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Happy Sufferer"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3978700","name":"Soul Redemption"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009930/13e2f4ec950b63e03a888ccf3b74d518d44f0584/header.jpg?t=1759501898","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4009930/2111683027/90c47adbbf3ceaf529e0d4294bb2eb116d16ef31/1759500759/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759501895","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4009930/2111683027/90c47adbbf3ceaf529e0d4294bb2eb116d16ef31/1759500759/dash_h264.mpd?t=175950